Did you know

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:39.405
Four or five thousand years ago

00:10:39.405 --> 00:10:42.475
Neolithic sites in northern China

00:10:42.475 --> 00:10:45.345
There is evidence that millet is used to make wine.

00:10:45.345 --> 00:10:47.914
Starting from the Xia and Shang dynasties

00:10:47.914 --> 00:10:50.617
Millet is the staple food of northerners.

00:10:50.617 --> 00:10:53.853
In the past, millet was called "Su"(transliteration) in China.

00:10:53.853 --> 00:10:57.524
"Su"(transliteration) culture was passed down from ancient times to the Song, Liao and Jin dynasties.

00:10:57.524 --> 00:11:00.226
Even now in the north of the mainland

00:11:00.226 --> 00:11:01.995
Mother gives birth to a child

