After the mother gave birth

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:09.536
Even now in the northern part of the mainland

00:11:09.536 --> 00:11:11.771
After the mother gives birth

00:11:11.771 --> 00:11:14.107
also drink millet porridge to nourish my body.

00:11:14.107 --> 00:11:16.676
You think China is the kingdom of millet production

00:11:16.676 --> 00:11:18.478
Humph, no

00:11:18.478 --> 00:11:19.913
India is

00:11:19.913 --> 00:11:22.415
The world's largest millet producer

00:11:22.415 --> 00:11:23.650
Not only can cook porridge

00:11:23.650 --> 00:11:25.985
Others also make big pancakes and thin pancakes

00:11:25.985 --> 00:11:29.489
Cooked with lentils for a delicious meal

00:11:29.489 --> 00:11:31.958
heard that even in 2018

00:11:31.958 --> 00:11:35.595
The Indian government announced that the year would be the year

00:11:35.595 --> 00:11:37.463
